1
00:00:39,764 --> 00:00:45,760
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:48,672
=Episode 13=

3
00:00:58,159 --> 00:00:58,920
(What she said)

4
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,560
is what you think,

5
00:01:01,479 --> 00:01:02,048
right?

6
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,280
Right?

7
00:01:16,468 --> 00:01:19,360
♪Lies woven from mud and conspiracy♪

8
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,440
♪Trap our fate♪

9
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:26,112
♪The knot tied between love and hate♪

10
00:01:26,112 --> 00:01:28,160
♪Shatters under your blade♪

11
00:01:29,152 --> 00:01:32,512
♪Pear blossoms fall,
scattering old grievances♪

12
00:01:32,512 --> 00:01:36,384
♪Hidden thoughts grow fierce
in the silence♪

13
00:01:36,384 --> 00:01:39,328
♪If all past entanglements
could be forgotten♪

14
00:01:39,328 --> 00:01:42,560
♪Leaving only longing behind♪

15
00:01:43,731 --> 00:01:50,496
♪Letting you cast the dream into flames
to end it all♪

16
00:01:50,496 --> 00:01:54,816
♪Burn away the snow in my memory♪

17
00:01:54,816 --> 00:01:57,600
♪That cruel deceit♪

18
00:01:57,600 --> 00:02:02,080
♪Let me crave one last time♪

19
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:02,848
(Lizhi,)

20
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,519
(are you all right?)

21
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:07,296
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

22
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:10,944
♪May we never meet in the next life♪

23
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,479
I won't die anyway, will I?

24
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,759
Do you plan
on suffering like this forever?

25
00:02:31,759 --> 00:02:33,360
This is my own business.

26
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,400
Nothing to do with her.

27
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,760
♪Writing our farewell♪

28
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:41,728
♪Red candles flicker
as I fall once more♪

29
00:02:41,984 --> 00:02:45,664
♪Holding your face closer still♪

30
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:48,479
The Yue family

31
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,520
is panicking over Yue Qiyang's injuries

32
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,319
and hasn't made a move yet.

33
00:02:52,919 --> 00:02:54,120
But Master Lizhi

34
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,599
has also vanished.

35
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,439
Master Lizhi cares so much
about Lady Wangshu.

36
00:02:58,759 --> 00:02:59,919
Why would he disappear now?

37
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:03,280
Master, forgive my boldness,

38
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,599
but I urge you to leave Daizhou for now.

39
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,360
Prince Qi already wants you dead.

40
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,120
Now that

41
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:11,159
the General's Manor's heir got hurt,

42
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:13,759
they will do everything
to uncover the truth

43
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,759
and retaliate.

44
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,800
If your identity is exposed,
I'm afraid...

45
00:03:18,439 --> 00:03:20,280
Coming to Daizhou was always a gamble.

46
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:21,599
Every crisis

47
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,120
brings opportunity.

48
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,800
But even if you dare to fight,

49
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,280
do the two Yue ladies

50
00:03:26,639 --> 00:03:27,400
dare to fight?

51
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,840
They only gathered evidence before

52
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,719
because the Yue family was off guard.

53
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,319
But things have changed.

54
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,280
Even if you suppressed the news,

55
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:36,919
Yue Qiyang's incident

56
00:03:36,919 --> 00:03:39,039
happened right after
Yue Wangshu was captured.

57
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:40,439
This cannot be kept hidden.

58
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,800
They will retaliate.

59
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,240
Dragged into the open

60
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:44,520
and surrounded by danger,

61
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,080
will they still step up?

62
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,800
- We will.
- We will.

63
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,680
If we hide,

64
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,319
we'll be in hiding for life.

65
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:56,879
We don't want that.

66
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,120
We're ready to fight.

67
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,039
Wangshu and I investigated

68
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,719
and gathered plenty of evidence.

69
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:16,399
Only these

70
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,639
won't topple the Yues.

71
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,959
Of course, these ledgers alone
won't seal it.

72
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,480
But with them,

73
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,000
you can rightfully look

74
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,439
into the General's Manor's estates

75
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,720
to uncover their other shocking crimes.

76
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,560
Yue Qiyang is badly wounded
and bedridden,

77
00:04:29,199 --> 00:04:30,519
leaving them without a leader.

78
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:32,439
This is when their guard is down.

79
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,879
Driven by panic and fury,

80
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,480
people always make mistakes.

81
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:39,079
That will give you the chance
to uproot them completely.

82
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:41,000
But if they are given time to recover

83
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,800
and conspire with Prince Qi again,

84
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,360
the situation

85
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,560
will spiral out of control.

86
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,920
You two ladies
possess remarkable courage.

87
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,600
No wonder an extraordinary man
protects and aids you.

88
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,519
Why hasn't Master Lizhi

89
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:56,759
joined us today?

90
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:59,480
Does he trust me enough

91
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,319
to let you speak on his behalf?

92
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,879
I truly admire

93
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:03,959
Master Lizhi's prowess.

94
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,439
I hope

95
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,240
he can join our discussion.

96
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,600
You are mistaken about one thing.

97
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:11,680
Wangshu and I risked our lives
to gather evidence,

98
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,920
putting everything on the line,

99
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,279
only to seek justice for ourselves

100
00:05:16,759 --> 00:05:18,040
and also offer you

101
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,279
a prime chance
to topple Prince Qi's faction.

102
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,319
No need to involve anyone else.

103
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,560
If you only care about Master Lizhi

104
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,480
and dismiss what we have done,

105
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,120
then forget this deal.

106
00:05:29,748 --> 00:05:31,060
(Silver Ledger)

107
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:34,519
Wangshu, let's go.

108
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,199
There has to be another way.

109
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:37,959
Lady Xingyao.

110
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,439
Are you all right?

111
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,519
I am fine.

112
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:52,519
Ladies,

113
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,079
please do not be offended.

114
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,879
Master Lizhi is noble.

115
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,120
I only wished to thank him in person.

116
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,519
If it is inconvenient for him,

117
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,959
let us drop the matter.

118
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:03,519
Let us make more preparations.

119
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,199
Once everything is ready,

120
00:06:05,519 --> 00:06:06,560
I will visit the yamen

121
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:08,959
to view Daizhou's
military payroll files.

122
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:10,319
No matter how

123
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,600
slippery Zhang Fan is,

124
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,600
he won't dare cheat me to my face.

125
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,800
By then,

126
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,720
you beat the grievance drum,

127
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:20,639
and I will accept your complaint myself.

128
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,279
(Memorial)
Tenth day of the fourth month.

129
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,439
Look here.

130
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,439
Three hundred taels.

131
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,519
Two hundred taels.

132
00:06:47,988 --> 00:06:50,752
♪Lies woven from mud and conspiracy♪

133
00:06:50,752 --> 00:06:52,608
♪Trap our fate♪

134
00:06:54,816 --> 00:06:57,408
♪The knot tied between love and hate♪

135
00:06:57,408 --> 00:07:00,256
♪Shatters under your blade♪

136
00:07:00,608 --> 00:07:03,584
♪Pear blossoms fall,
scattering old grievances♪

137
00:07:04,032 --> 00:07:07,680
♪Hidden thoughts grow fierce
in the silence♪

138
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,656
♪If all past entanglements
could be forgotten♪

139
00:07:10,784 --> 00:07:14,144
♪Leaving only longing behind♪

140
00:07:15,392 --> 00:07:18,016
♪Bound together by love's dark spell♪

141
00:07:18,176 --> 00:07:21,056
♪I draw closer to you despite the pain♪

142
00:07:21,152 --> 00:07:27,936
♪Could this illusion of sweetness
last a little longer?♪

143
00:07:31,348 --> 00:07:34,784
(Lizhi)

144
00:07:34,784 --> 00:07:39,104
♪Burn away the snow in my memory♪

145
00:07:39,104 --> 00:07:41,568
♪That cruel deceit♪

146
00:07:42,208 --> 00:07:46,016
(Li)

147
00:07:46,016 --> 00:07:48,608
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

148
00:07:48,608 --> 00:07:49,824
(Lizhi)

149
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:53,839
A name
carries your family's hopes for you.

150
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:54,879
You must remember.

151
00:07:58,132 --> 00:07:59,424
(Lizhi)

152
00:08:01,312 --> 00:08:02,740
(Lizhi)

153
00:08:03,008 --> 00:08:04,288
(Wangshu, Li)

154
00:08:07,252 --> 00:08:10,080
(Wangshu, Li)

155
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:13,024
♪Bleak rain grazes my fingertips♪

156
00:08:13,024 --> 00:08:15,520
♪Falling into the abyss♪

157
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:19,840
♪Karma weaves a fateful tribulation♪

158
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:22,048
♪Writing our farewell♪

159
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,920
Yue Wangshu,

160
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:28,399
standing atop high mountains,
watching the bright moon.

161
00:08:30,112 --> 00:08:32,864
♪I'd gladly drink poison
to quench this thirst♪

162
00:08:32,928 --> 00:08:36,160
♪A foolish dream left unfulfilled♪

163
00:08:37,344 --> 00:08:40,448
♪Bound together by love's dark spell♪

164
00:08:40,448 --> 00:08:43,456
♪I draw closer to you despite the pain♪

165
00:08:43,456 --> 00:08:50,080
♪Could this illusion of sweetness
last a little longer?♪

166
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:56,960
♪Letting you cast the dream into flames
to end it all♪

167
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,120
(Are you)

168
00:09:02,759 --> 00:09:03,679
(doing well?)

169
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:08,256
♪Let me crave one last time♪

170
00:09:08,256 --> 00:09:10,240
♪The gentle warmth in your eyes♪

171
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:14,016
♪How tender was our final kiss♪

172
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:18,752
(Daizhou Yamen)

173
00:09:20,928 --> 00:09:21,568
She came here!

174
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:39,279
Isn't that Lady Wangshu,
who was sacrificed to the Loong Lord?

175
00:09:39,799 --> 00:09:41,639
- H-How is she still alive?
- It really is her!

176
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:42,879
(Daizhou Yamen)
It's truly her!

177
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:45,728
Yes, that's her!

178
00:09:46,067 --> 00:09:46,676
Indeed!

179
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,039
Useless!

180
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,039
You let a single Zhu Heng hold you back?

181
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:53,279
Madam, Zhu Heng never leaves their side.

182
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:54,279
The Yue sisters

183
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:55,000
are very cautious.

184
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,360
We can't even get close to them.

185
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,120
B-Bad news!

186
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,240
Y-Yue Wangshu

187
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,799
beat the drum at the yamen!

188
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:02,279
The little wretch has run out of tricks.

189
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:04,320
Filing a complaint on our own turf?

190
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,120
Looks like Zhang Fan

191
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,399
has grown reckless.

192
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:09,639
Could it be that

193
00:10:09,639 --> 00:10:12,039
because his son tried
to force himself on Yue Xingyao

194
00:10:12,159 --> 00:10:13,159
but only broke his leg,

195
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,440
he turned against us?

196
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:17,840
Isn't he afraid his embezzlement
in the Loong Consort selection

197
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,720
will be exposed too?

198
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,039
It's the imperial censor.

199
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,679
He's at the yamen today,

200
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,639
auditing the military payroll records.

201
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,600
Yue Wangshu beat the drum

202
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,840
right in front of the censor
and the entire city.

203
00:10:29,759 --> 00:10:30,720
What?

204
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,240
Here, eat.

205
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,000
Won't eat it raw.

206
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,120
Won't eat it roasted.

207
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,440
You think toughing it out

208
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,799
will heal all your wounds?

209
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:54,720
You should go up.

210
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,159
No.

211
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:58,519
You don't have to see her.

212
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,840
At least

213
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,519
find some good food

214
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,039
and bring some back for me.

215
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:07,039
Besides,

216
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:09,519
if something happens to her,

217
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:10,559
with you there,

218
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,200
you can help her in secret, right?

219
00:11:25,587 --> 00:11:26,368
(Daizhou Yamen)

220
00:11:26,496 --> 00:11:27,159
They're here.

221
00:11:27,159 --> 00:11:28,120
Who beats the drum?

222
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,399
I, Yue Wangshu,

223
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:31,240
have a grave injustice.

224
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,679
I accuse the Guardian General's Manor.

225
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,080
Today, written in blood,

226
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,960
I accuse the Yues' first branch

227
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,200
of framing the loyal,

228
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,919
embezzling my parents' estate,

229
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,200
and using the Loong Consort sacrifice

230
00:11:42,639 --> 00:11:44,000
to murder their own kin.

231
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,720
I beg the Prefect to grant me justice,

232
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:48,799
justice for my wronged parents,

233
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,240
and justice for the laws of the land.

234
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:06,639
The Prefect is ill. No complaints today.

235
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:11,120
Who knows if Prefect Zhang
is really sick or faking it.

236
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,360
Leaving the censor waiting

237
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:13,480
is utterly disgraceful.

238
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,440
Zhang Fan claims he is ill?

239
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:22,240
He's likely trying to stall.

240
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:25,200
After all, he's Prince Qi's man,

241
00:12:25,519 --> 00:12:26,799
and this is the Yues' domain.

242
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:29,399
He thinks stalling for a few days

243
00:12:29,919 --> 00:12:31,399
will make us back down.

244
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,200
Fine.

245
00:12:34,039 --> 00:12:34,720
Very well.

246
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,759
Prefect Zhang
is one of General Yue's men.

247
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:40,600
Daizhou is the Yue family's turf.

248
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:42,240
The locals have the upper hand.

249
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,200
Exactly.

250
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:46,519
They're here.

251
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:50,440
Ladies,

252
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,399
the censor

253
00:12:51,759 --> 00:12:53,360
invites you inside to wait.

254
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:55,759
No. According to the law,

255
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,600
we'll kneel until court convenes.

256
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,440
Then just wait. Let's go.

257
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,480
They can kneel till dark,

258
00:13:01,919 --> 00:13:03,039
but if Lord Zhang plays ill,

259
00:13:03,399 --> 00:13:05,120
he won't come out.

260
00:13:05,759 --> 00:13:08,000
The next Loong Consort selection
is coming up.

261
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:09,039
Such a time

262
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:11,679
is the busiest time and the easiest time

263
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:13,440
to rake in money in our city.

264
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:15,000
Prefect Zhang will definitely use this

265
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,000
to extort everyone.

266
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:16,639
Exactly.

267
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:17,799
He's nothing but a parasite.

268
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:18,496
That's right.

269
00:13:20,628 --> 00:13:22,480
(Zhang Fan, Prefect of Daizhou)

270
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,399
Squire Li,

271
00:13:24,039 --> 00:13:26,039
right before the imperial censor,
someone filed

272
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,000
a complaint.

273
00:13:27,399 --> 00:13:28,320
I'm sick

274
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,919
and have no time for that.

275
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,600
Look at this pile of paperwork.

276
00:13:31,759 --> 00:13:32,639
As for your matter,

277
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:33,879
I really cannot help.

278
00:13:34,559 --> 00:13:35,120
See him out.

279
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:35,936
Wait.

280
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,559
My Lord, my daughter

281
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,600
is everything to me!

282
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,679
It is just that
your daughter's birth chart

283
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,120
matches the Loong God's

284
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,960
so perfectly.

285
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:47,960
I am

286
00:13:48,279 --> 00:13:49,879
willing to gild the Loong God's statue

287
00:13:49,879 --> 00:13:51,320
with thirty thousand taels.

288
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:58,480
Squire Li,

289
00:13:59,159 --> 00:14:00,720
to be sacrificed to the Loong God

290
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,720
is an enormous blessing.

291
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:06,000
It's an honor
others could only dream of.

292
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,240
100 thousand.

293
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:11,120
I'll pay 100 thousand.

294
00:14:13,399 --> 00:14:17,720
I vaguely recall your daughter
is already betrothed.

295
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,159
Is that so?

296
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,519
Yes, yes.

297
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:25,840
She has long been betrothed
to the Wang family in the west of town.

298
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,872
The wedding is next month.

299
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,279
A maiden sacrificed to the Loong God

300
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,240
must be chaste

301
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:35,320
and free from any betrothal.

302
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,440
That is the rule set by the ancestors.

303
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:39,840
We cannot be careless.

304
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:46,624
(Ren Cailian, Li Baochai)

305
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,120
Thank you, My Lord!

306
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,080
It seems

307
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:54,480
this grand honor
will not befall your Li family.

308
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,399
Since Li Baochai won't do,

309
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:59,000
is there another candidate?

310
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:00,120
My Lord,

311
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:02,039
Squire Xu in the south of town

312
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,080
has a younger daughter, Xu Yuzhu,

313
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,360
who is sixteen.

314
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:10,120
Squire Li, you're close friends
with Squire Xu.

315
00:15:10,919 --> 00:15:12,240
Deliver this good news

316
00:15:12,519 --> 00:15:14,159
to him on my behalf.

317
00:15:14,799 --> 00:15:15,600
I

318
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,519
will deliver it.

319
00:15:21,559 --> 00:15:22,080
My Lord,

320
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:22,679
another fortune made!

321
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:23,840
Here.

322
00:15:40,659 --> 00:15:45,234
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

323
00:15:46,009 --> 00:15:50,506
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

324
00:15:53,745 --> 00:15:58,867
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

325
00:15:58,867 --> 00:16:02,206
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

326
00:16:02,206 --> 00:16:03,570
♪Refusing to forget♪

327
00:16:07,236 --> 00:16:12,013
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

328
00:16:12,564 --> 00:16:14,354
♪He cannot learn them♪

329
00:16:14,354 --> 00:16:17,489
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

330
00:16:20,641 --> 00:16:22,965
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

331
00:16:22,965 --> 00:16:25,328
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

332
00:16:25,906 --> 00:16:28,570
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

333
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:30,328
♪Their days ahead are long♪
